## The street circuit used by the Online room TV racer (race_sim.gd drives on it, race_world.gd and kart_race_view.gd
## draw it). A closed loop of about 1.66 km along a harbour: a 330 m main straight, a fast sweeper, an S chicane, a long
## right into a hairpin, a climb through two esses and a tunnel over the hill, then a descent to a bridge over the inlet
## and a last fast left back to the harbour. The tightest corner has a radius of ~24 m.
## COORDS = x / z in metres, evenly spaced (~3 m); HEIGHTS = height of the road surface at the same points. The height is
## only for looks (hills, crests): the driving physics are flat. Convention: tangent = direction of travel (horizontal),
## side = tangent rotated to the driver's right, curvature > 0 = right turn.

